      "content": "Hey, I'm putting together a literature review for a paper on evolutionary behavioral phenotypes. I'm looking into the data regarding how different ethnic and ancestral populations might show variations in traits like risk-taking propensity or social cohesion levels based on evolutionary pressures. Can you help me find some of the core arguments or studies that discuss these population-level behavioral differences?",
